TOKEN tinybird_read READ

DESCRIPTION >
    Google Search Console performance responses for sc-domain:pollinations.ai (all subdomains,
    web search), appended daily by .github/workflows/data-sync-search-console-tinybird.yml.
    Search Console keeps 16 months, so each body is stored as returned for later analysis.
    Datasets per day: totals (country, device; includes queries Google hides), queries
    (query, country, device), pages (page, country, device; our own page routes only, since
    Google indexes image URLs containing prompts). Days are Pacific time, countries ISO
    alpha-3. A report over 25,000 rows spans responses told apart by start_row. Every
    response of a run shares fetched_at: the latest fetched_at per dataset and date is one
    complete report.

SCHEMA >
    `dataset` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.dataset`,
    `date` Date `json:$.date`,
    `start_row` UInt32 `json:$.start_row`,
    `fetched_at` DateTime `json:$.fetched_at`,
    `body` String `json:$.body`

ENGINE "MergeTree"
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY "dataset, date, start_row, fetched_at"
